# Week 7 — American Put RL Environment
### MDP formulation, environment implementation, and baseline policy comparison

Code: `american_put_env.py` (reproduces every number and figure below).
Run with `python american_put_env.py` — no extra setup beyond `numpy` and
`matplotlib`. All randomness is seeded (see **Reproducibility** at the end).

